refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
public mixedFiber::throw Throwableexception
दिइएको exception लाई current Fiber::suspend call बाट from throw गरी fiber लाई resume गर्छ। यदि यो method call गर्दा fiber suspended छैन भने, एउटा FiberError throw हुनेछ।

  &reftitle.parameters;


    exception


current Fiber::suspend call from fiber भित्र throw गरिने exception।

  &reftitle.examples;



<?php

$fiber = new Fiber(function () {
   try {
       // Suspend execution of the fiber declaring an interruption point
       Fiber::suspend();
   } catch (Throwable $e) {
       echo $e->getMessage();
   }
});

$fiber->start();

// Resumes execution of the fiber with
// passing the Exception to throw at the interruption point
$fiber->throw(new Exception('Message of an exception thrown at the current interrupt point'));

?>


   &example.outputs.similar;


Message of an exception thrown at the current interrupt point
